,"_170":171,"_172":173,"_174":187,"_176":177},{"_164":165,"_166":167,"_168":169,"_170":171,"_172":173,"_174":175,"_176":177},"_key","1568440456bf","_type","block","children",[178],"level",1,"listItem","bullet","markDefs",[],"style","normal",{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":182,"_183":184},"e54cc8ba19a7","span","marks",[],"text","Maximised use of a compact urban site","760f108e2ef5",[188],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":189,"_183":190},[],"Energy-efficient construction","a00f89e4525c",[194],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":195,"_183":196},[],"Luxury bathrooms with designer fixtures","d29b517b5931",[200],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":201,"_183":202},[],"High ceilings and expansive glazing","4dc16c01bf0d",[206],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":207,"_183":208},[],"Premium natural stone finishes","8e37c2302111",[212],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":213,"_183":214},[],"Custom-designed joinery throughout","46f2efb85ac5",[218],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":219,"_183":220},[],"Designer kitchen with premium appliances","df89c3404ecf",[224],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":225,"_183":226},[],"Open-plan kitchen, living and dining","4a3267b6798d",[230],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":231,"_183":232},[],"Premium architectural façade","7f860b5a529a",[236],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":237,"_183":238},[],"Architecturally designed contemporary home","5ac407ef52f1",[242],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":243,"_183":244},[],"Built on a 300sqm inner-city allotment","7a4121cab82c",[248],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":249,"_183":250},[],"Approximately 335sqm (36 Squares) custom residence","1ca9cd236cca",[255],[],"h3",{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":256,"_183":257},[],"Key Features","8ba20743643c",[261],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":262,"_183":263},[],"Every aspect of the home has been carefully considered to deliver a residence that is both functional and visually striking, demonstrating our commitment to quality and innovation.","9461264a2d82",[267],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":268,"_183":269},[],"Siari Build managed the project from planning through to construction, coordinating every stage to ensure a seamless building process. By combining intelligent design, efficient site management and exceptional craftsmanship, the project maximises every square metre of the allotment while creating spacious, light-filled living areas and a premium architectural finish.","069ec55841ed",[273],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":274,"_183":275},[],"Our Solution","fee527c28b83",[279],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":280,"_183":281},[],"Managing planning approvals, demolition, engineering, protection works and construction sequencing while maintaining safety, quality and efficiency required strong project management and close coordination with consultants, authorities and trades.","81d15e42d8b7",[285],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":286,"_183":287},[],"Constructing a luxury custom home within Melbourne’s inner-city environment presented a unique set of challenges. The compact 300sqm site, close proximity to neighbouring properties, restricted access and extensive council requirements demanded meticulous planning before construction could commence.","9ae5de5ebb23",[291],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":292,"_183":293},[],"The Challenge","9312f000e9b5",[297],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":298,"_183":299},[],"Located in one of Melbourne’s most established suburbs, this project reflects Siari Build’s ability to deliver high-quality custom homes on challenging urban sites where careful planning, precision and attention to detail are essential.","48b27a3a1a57",[303],[],{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":304,"_183":305},[],"The Collingwood Residence is a bespoke 36-square architecturally designed custom home currently under construction on a 300sqm inner-city allotment. Designed to maximise space, natural light and modern family living, the residence combines contemporary architecture with premium finishes and exceptional craftsmanship.","ce610f70c49f",[310],[],"h2",{"_164":179,"_166":180,"_181":311,"_183":312},[],"Overview",{"_314":315,"_316":317},"settings",{"_353":354,"_355":356,"_357":358,"_359":360,"_361":101,"_362":363,"_364":-5,"_365":366,"_367":321,"_368":-5,"_369":-5,"_370":321,"_371":372,"_373":374,"_375":376,"_377":378,"_379":-5,"_380":381,"_382":383,"_119":384,"_385":386,"_387":388},"navigation",{"_318":319,"_320":321,"_322":323,"_324":325},"footerMenu",[346,347,348,349,350],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[331,332,333,334],"socialMenu",[326],{"_327":-5,"_328":329,"_129":330},"icon","label","Instagram","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_328":-5,"_336":344,"_338":345},{"_328":-5,"_336":342,"_338":343},{"_328":-5,"_336":340,"_338":341},{"_328":335,"_336":337,"_338":339},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Projects","about","About","home","Home",{"_328":-5,"_336":344,"_338":345},{"_328":-5,"_336":342,"_338":343},{"_328":-5,"_336":340,"_338":341},{"_328":-5,"_336":337,"_338":339},{"_328":-5,"_336":351,"_338":352},"privacy-policy","Privacy Policy","address","Point Cook, Victoria","copyrightText","All rights reserved.","email","info@siaribuild.com.au","legalLine","ABN 20 688 039 894 | Builder License CDB-U 101713","maintenanceEnabled","maintenanceHeading","WE'RE ON THE TOOLS.","maintenanceImage","maintenanceMessage","The site's getting a quick upgrade and will be back shortly. In the meantime, if you'd like to start a project, reach us using the options below.","maintenanceShowContact","mapAddressLabel","mapAreaRadius","mapHidePin","mapLocation",{"_166":389,"_390":391,"_392":393,"_394":395},"mapZoom",12,"notFoundButtonLabel","Back to Home","notFoundHeading","THIS ONE'S OFF THE PLANS.","notFoundImage","notFoundMessage","The page you're after isn't here — moved, renamed, or never built. Let's get you back to solid ground.","phone","0419 000 991","Siari Build","tagline","We don't just build houses. We build the next forty years of your life.","workingHours","Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\nSaturday: 9:00 AM - 2:00 PM\nSunday: Closed","geopoint","alt",7,"lat",-37.895696,"lng",144.76186]
